event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":92,"item_id":"rs_023d05c3f562fdcd016acb987c63bc819386da962f03720d40","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Refining chunk handling**\n\nI want to keep things simple and not overdo it. There could be a minor fix needed for splitting UTF-8 chunk names related to body buffers; while it's not absolutely necessary, I think it would be good to address. I should also consider implementing a stop test that halts on failure after the first attempt to avoid rare hangs. Overall, I think I’m in a good place with these ideas and need to update the README."}

